===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Partially [[automatic]].
# Of a [[firearm]] that [[automatically]] [[eject]]s a [[shell]] and [[load]]s the next one, but requires the [[trigger]] to be [[squeeze]]d for each [[shot]]; [[autoloading]].
#: {{cot|en|fully-automatic}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2008-09-17|author=|title=Bill in House forces capital to relax gun restrictions|work=w:The New York Times|url=https://www.nytimes.com/2008/09/17/world/americas/17iht-guns.5.16252232.html
|passage=The pro-gun majority in the House of Representatives moved Wednesday to compel the nation's capital to broaden the rights of its residents to buy and own firearms, including '''semi-automatic''' weapons.}}

